ith missing formaldehyde measurement, the average value of available measurements of the other schools was applied.</p></fn><fn id="tfn20-ehp0116-000090"><label>*</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05.</p></fn><fn id="tfn21-ehp0116-000090"><label>**</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.01.</p></fn><fn id="tfn22-ehp0116-000090"><label>#</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.001.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>